<title>USA: Richardson ISD, Texas, $30 mln won by Zions Bank.</title>
<headline>Richardson ISD, Texas, $30 mln won by Zions Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions Bank Capital Markets Group said it won $30 million of Richardson ISD, Texas variable rate school building bonds, Series 1997 A, with an initial rate of 3.62 percent.</p>
</text>
